  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/420/241/tiny-pvp-swords-and-tool.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"952\" height=\"62\"></p>\n<p><strong>描述</strong></p>\n<p>我制作此资源包是为了配合我的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/best-pvp\" rel=\"nofollow\">最佳PVP整合包</a> 使用，并决定将其作为独立版本发布。所有剑在Photoshop中裁剪了5x5像素并缩小了尺寸。工具则裁剪了4x4像素。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>更小的武器和工具将为你的屏幕腾出更多空间，进一步提升原版游戏体验，对PVP非常实用。所有纹理均源自原版游戏，但尺寸更小。</p>\n<p>此资源包还包含一个PVP准星。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/420/240/untitled-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/457/563/2022-04-26_22.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">立即租用服务器并与好友一起畅玩！点击 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 或下方横幅，并使用兑换码 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 享受25%折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
